    "id": "Kebun tropis yang rimbun: daun monstera, pisang dan pakis, bunga kamboja, bingkai anyaman rotan dan foto berbentuk daun. Sampul terbuka seperti dedaunan yang tersibak.",
    "en": "A lush tropical garden: monstera, banana and fern leaves, frangipani, woven rattan frames and leaf-shaped photos. The cover opens like parting foliage."
